OL,3,GNEWSALast Post Office in town centre to
OL,4,Aclose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last Post Office in a town centre
OL,7,Fis set to close after it was announced
OL,8,Fdozens of high street shops would be
OL,9,Fshuttered.
OL,11,FIt was announced in July that up to 150
OL,12,Fbranches TG Jones, WHSmith's former
OL,13,Fhigh street business, would shut as
OL,14,Fpart of a major restructure. Among them
OL,15,Fwas the shop in Shropshire's Telford
OL,16,FCentre, meaning the branch Post Office
OL,17,Fwill now also close.
OL,19,FThe Post Office is due to close on 2
OL,20,FJanuary, a week before the TG Jones
OL,21,Fstore itself is boarded up.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
