OL,3,GNEWSALast Post Office in town centre to
OL,4,Aclose
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Post Office spokesperson told the BBC
OL,7,Fthey fully recognised "the challenging
OL,8,Ftrading conditions that TG Jones and
OL,9,Fmany other High Street retailers are
OL,10,Ffacing at the moment".
